Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Erdos-Szekeres Point Sets", "Section", ExpressionUUID->"03acf8d8-fd75-4777-a62f-99e275a5b9bd"],

Cell["\<\
These point sets contain no convex 5-gon, 6-gon, and 7-gon, respectively. The \
32-point set is the integer-coordinate example of Duque, Fabila-Monroy, and \
Hidalgo-Toscano (2018).\
\>", "Text", ExpressionUUID->"32eb9d69-b2b9-479f-8982-fae682edd23e"],

